, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">작은 책상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">낮은 천장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">층 침대 사용자</span></p></pre><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; padding: 10px; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(159, 211, 49); background-color: rgb(231, 253, 181);\"><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; text-wrap: nowrap;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">FAQ</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\n\n</span></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">  Q. </span><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일반선발기간 내 신청 중 기혼자실이랑 장애인실이 신청페이지에 왜 없나요?</span></font></span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br></span></font></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">     ☞ </span><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">기혼자실, 장애인실은 우선선발, 추가선발에만 지원가능합니다.</span><br></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">  Q. </span><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일반선발 최대 지망까지 다 선택해야 신청되는건가요?</span><br></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">     ☞ </span><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일반선발은 최대지망까지 클릭해야 신청이 가능합니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-wrap: nowrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\n  Q. 동계방학에 거주하던 호실이 달라지나요?\n     ☞ 호실 변동 있습니다. \n\n</span></font></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">  Q</span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. 공고문에 나온 신청 기간 말고는 신청을 못하나요?\n     ☞ 네, 신청기간 외에는 신청이 불가합니다.\n\n</span></font></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">  Q</span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. 선발 결과, 납부계좌는 언제 확인할 수 있나요?\n</span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">     </span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">☞ 신청하신 선발의 등록기간 첫날부터 원스톱서비스에서 확인 가능합니다.\n         예) 우선선발 선발결과 → 우선선발 등록기간인 1. 10.(수) 10시부터 원스톱서비스(생활관선발결과 및 고지서출력)에서 확인 가능</span><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\n\n</span></font></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap;\">  Q</span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><font color=\"#212529\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. 우선선발, 일반선발, 추가선발 중 저는 어느 관에 신청할 수 있나요?\n     ☞ 공고문의 14페이지에서 우선, 일반선발에 신청가능 관을 확인하실 수 있습니다. </span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">         추가선발때는 모든 관에 신청가능합니다. 자세한 사항은 첨부파일의 공고문을 확인하시기 바랍니다. \n\n</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  Q</span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. 담당자 전화번호가 어떻게 되나요?\n</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">     </span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Batang, 바탕, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">☞ 선발 문의: 054-478-7943\n         ☞ 생활관비 문의: 푸름관비: 7201, 오름관비 7947(오름관2·3동 공공요금 예치금 포함)\n         ☞ 푸름관·아름관 시설(공사, 고장 포함) 문의: 7946\n         ☞ 오름관 시설(공사, 고장 포함) 문의: 각 관 운영사: 오름관1동(070-8786-5001), 오름관2동(070-7209-6070), </span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">오름관3동(070-7198-1650)</span></p></div><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; text-wrap: wrap; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; text-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; text-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; text-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; text-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmGYHoEZkgLAzgUwJoHUBaAhbBhAE3QFcAxAFQDNyBHAFwE8A3AOgCsAHAcyA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; text-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; text-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; text-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p></pre>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
